# Title: 7Zip Compressing Dump Files
# ID: ec570e53-4c76-45a9-804d-dc3f355ff7a7
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-09-27
# Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1560.001
# Description: Detects execution of 7z in order to compress a file with a ".dmp"/".dump" extension, which could be a step in a process of dump file exfiltration.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*.dmp*" OR process_exec="*.dump*" OR process_exec="*.hdmp*")) AND ((Description="*7-Zip*") OR ((process_path="*\\7z.exe" OR process_path="*\\7zr.exe" OR process_path="*\\7za.exe")) OR ((process_name="7z.exe" OR process_name="7za.exe" OR process_name="7zr.exe"))))
